{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act16side_level_act16side_st01",
  "groupId": "act16side",
  "stageId": "act16side_st01",
  "title": "风云际会",
  "storyCode": "GA-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3120c221e752c1e08e5a2b2533b1efa2986001f31ccc8ac4dcca81ec9b153700",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "st01"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "消瘦的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她快回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉静的女人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "万国信使们筹备已久的会议，她当然会回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉静的女人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你打算待多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "消瘦的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到该做的事情做完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "消瘦的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟我在这里，只能引渡拉特兰人的灵魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "消瘦的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "消瘦的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我该走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉静的女人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明天开始，别再来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g8_laterano_dwelling"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈，喝热水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好孩子，咳咳......妈妈没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈......我给你读故事书吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......塞茜莉亚，我可爱的塞茜莉亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈真舍不得离开你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈要离开我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，咳咳......妈妈从来没有想过......离开你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈只是不得不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈要去哪儿？我也一起去，可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈要去的地方，塞茜莉亚不能去......那里很冷，很寂寞，什么都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和妈妈一起，我陪着妈妈，妈妈就不会寂寞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......塞茜莉亚，对不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你本应该有更幸福的童年......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和妈妈在一起，非常幸福。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......塞茜莉亚，塞茜莉亚，听着，听着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈，我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之后，妈妈不能照顾你了......会有人来接你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟着他，跟着他去找爸爸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸会代替妈妈照顾你，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈不和我一起去见爸爸吗？爸爸一定也想要见妈妈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈......要去做重要的事情......所以不能和你一起去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你见到爸爸，替妈妈告诉他，妈妈也很想他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有，替我对他说......对不起。好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈为什么要道歉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "答应我，答应妈妈，塞茜莉亚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道了，妈妈......妈妈，别哭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞茜莉亚，我可怜的塞茜莉亚......你的出生是我一生中最幸福的事。可是，这会不会成为你一生的不幸......我的孩子，我最心爱的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁将祝福你？谁能祝福你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞茜莉亚，我的塞茜莉亚，躲起来，不要被发现......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "逃走吧......离开拉特兰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "母亲抓住女儿的手，眸中闪过无数情绪。最终，一切都从眼中无力地流逝。\n那双眼睛缓缓阖上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萨科塔女孩不知道发生了什么。\n她发现母亲的手变凉了，于是捧起来捂在胸前，希望母亲能够暖和一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是敲门声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特兰公证所执行者费德里科，执行公务，请开门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g9_laterano_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开朗的万国信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，宾馆的入住手续已经全部办妥啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开朗的万国信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天接下来的时间您可以自行安排，出门逛逛也很不错。在路上时，看您似乎很有兴致呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特兰城的建筑，风格别致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开朗的万国信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您看，来拉特兰一趟不虚此行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之后的日程呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开朗的万国信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您与教宗阁下的会面已经安排妥当，接下来我将前往大教堂归队。明天，我会来接引您会见教宗阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开朗的万国信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正如之前向您介绍的，会议期间，您可以尽情享受在拉特兰的时光，不必顾虑费用，拉特兰城很荣幸能招待各国贵宾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各国贵宾......哎，我是不知道这么多异国人聚在这里，能有什么好谈的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，教宗阁下有如此诚意，我自然很愿意领略一番贵地的人情风貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "开朗的万国信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，容我先失陪了。您请随意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g10_laterano_roof"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g11_laterano_alley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特兰城的建筑确实有意思......哥伦比亚也会用这种柱式，不过细节似乎有所不同......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，来都来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？那边在做些什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安装好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好了，你那边呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搞定。艾泽尔小哥，周边都疏散好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能受到直接影响的公民已经疏散完毕，次级影响范围内的公民也已经确认知晓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我们可以开始了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......现在是1099年3月15日上午10时22分，接下来这次爆破行为，将在公证所候补执行者艾泽尔的见证下执行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嘞。那么，三——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（那三个萨科塔围在那根柱子旁做什么？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里怎么除了你们三个之外，一个人都没有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一，引爆！——喂，哪儿来的人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了，怎么爆炸了！......什么东西倒下来了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救命，救命啊！噫——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要救人......嗯？倒塌的速度，变慢了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "闭嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噫——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这、这太可怕了，拉特兰是怎么回事！......这位黎博利，感谢你的搭救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你叫什么名字？请到哥伦比亚临时会馆找我，我会答谢你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她叫微光守夜人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "微光守夜人",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "微光守夜人......？拉特兰人的名字真奇怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "微光守夜人",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不叫这个名字。"
