    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不叫微光守夜人的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，这到底是怎么回事？光天化日，大街上怎么会爆炸？难道拉特兰混进了犯罪分子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g11_laterano_alley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在思考一件事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说说看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不觉得这根柱子的位置很完美吗？"
