    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我同意，拉特兰的建筑美学在它身上体现得淋漓尽致。所以呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......我忍不住想看一看，把它炸掉会是什么效果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳？的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不得不承认，是个好主意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，那个会议是不是快开始了？听说会有很多外宾。教宗阁下是不是说，让大家这段时间收敛一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳？的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳？？的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，教宗阁下说的是“收敛一点”，没有说“不能做”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我理解教宗阁下希望给外宾们留下好印象。不过，我亲爱的朋友，你是否同意我的一点浅见——“好的印象”首先应当符合实际。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不太沉稳的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的朋友，我认为你说得很对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g11_laterano_alley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我们就向公证所报备了一下，请这位执行者小哥来见证了一下，把周围民众疏散了一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后将这根美丽的柱子，恰如其分地爆破了一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，没想到您正好走了过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，尊敬的先生，我们无意伤害您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们......在移动城市的大街上搞爆炸？还向政府报备......在公务员的见证下？！拉特兰人......原来这么......洒脱不羁吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不叫微光守夜人的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特兰人当然遵守戒律和规则。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不叫微光守夜人的黎博利",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但在戒律允许的范围内，拉特兰人有想做的事，就会去做。而拉特兰城会尊重和保障每一位拉特兰公民的权益。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别担心，先生。只是爆炸而已，这很平常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是有人受伤怎么办......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们懂得分寸......当然，我为这次意外向您致歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉稳的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真抱歉，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的拉特兰市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许现在您还不太理解。相信我，在这里生活一段时间，您会爱上这座城市的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......我可能还是不必理解了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是拉特兰人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欢迎来到拉特兰，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g11_laterano_alley"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧啧，不愧是莫斯提马，她的能力究竟是让时间流逝变慢，还是让人产生变慢的错觉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看几次都觉得不可思议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的万国信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奥伦，那边怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么，亲切的家乡日常而已。"
